﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿---
// iShine Contact Page — Develo-style design
import { t } from '../lib/i18n';
import { getLocalizedPath } from '../lib/breadcrumbs';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';

const locale = Astro.currentLocale ?? (Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/tr') ? 'tr' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/ar') ? 'ar' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/es') ? 'es' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/fr') ? 'fr' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/ru') ? 'ru' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/he') ? 'he' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/pt-BR') ? 'pt-BR' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/pt-PT') ? 'pt-PT' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/ro') ? 'ro' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/ko') ? 'ko' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/ja') ? 'ja' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/pl') ? 'pl' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/nl') ? 'nl' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/id') ? 'id' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/fa') ? 'fa' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/el') ? 'el' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/th') ? 'th' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/vi') ? 'vi' : Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/it') ? 'it' : startsWith('/de') ? 'de' : 'en');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang={locale} dir={locale === 'ar' || locale === 'he' || locale === 'fa' ? 'rtl' : 'ltr'}>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<script is:inline>
  // 语言偏好持久化：读取用户选定的语言（localStorage），
  // 若当前 URL 语言与偏好不一致，立即重定向到偏好语言对应页面（支持 en/tr/ar）
  (function () {
    var KEY = 'ishine_lang';
    try {
      var stored = localStorage.getItem(KEY);
      if (!stored) return;
      var LANGS = ['tr', 'ro', 'ar', 'es', 'fr', 'ru', 'he', 'fa', 'el', 'pt-BR', 'pt-PT', 'nl', 'id', 'th', 'pl', 'ja', 'ko', 'cs', 'vi', 'it', 'de'];
      var path = window.location.pathname;
      var cur = 'en';
      for (var i = 0; i < LANGS.length; i++) {
        if (path === '/' + LANGS[i] || path.indexOf('/' + LANGS[i] + '/') === 0) {
          cur = LANGS[i];
          break;
        }
      }
      if (stored === cur) return;
      var stripped = path;
      for (var j = 0; j < LANGS.length; j++) {
        stripped = stripped.replace(new RegExp('^/' + LANGS[j] + '/?'), '');
      }
      if (stored === 'en') {
        stripped = stripped.replace(/\/+$/, '');
        if (stripped === '' || stripped === '/') stripped = '/';
        if (stripped !== path) window.location.replace(stripped);
      } else {
        var target = '/' + stored + (stripped === '' || stripped === '/' ? '' : stripped);
        target = target.replace(/\/+$/, '');
        if (target === '') target = '/' + stored;
        if (target !== path) window.location.replace(target);
      }
    } catch (e) { /* 隐私模式等场景忽略 */ }
  })();
</script>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/logos/ishine%20favicon.png" />
<title>{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.pageTitle')}</title>
<meta name="description" content={t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.pageDescription')} />

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Syne:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--blue:#563cfa;--black:#020303;--white:#fff;--grey-50:#f9fafb;--grey-100:#f3f4f6;--grey-200:#e5e7eb;--grey-400:#9ca3af;--grey-500:#6b7280;--grey-text:#4b5563;--max-w:1536px;--pad-100:100px;--pad-40:40px;--pad-24:24px}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;overflow-x:hidden}
body{font-family:Manrope,-apple-system,Roboto,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:#000;background:#fff;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}

/* ═══ 1. TRUST BAR ═══ */
.trust-bar{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;height:60px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:transparent;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .1s ease,transform .1s ease;will-change:opacity,transform}
.trust-bar.trust-bar-hidden{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-100%);pointer-events:none}
.trust-bar-inner{display:flex;align-items:center}
.trust-slide{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 24px;background:transparent;transition:opacity .2s ease}
.trust-slide[aria-hidden="true"]{display:none}
.trust-slide[aria-hidden="false"]{display:flex}
.trust-icon{flex-shrink:0}
.trust-text{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:#020303;line-height:25px}
@media(max-width:768px){.trust-slide{padding:10px 16px}.trust-text{font-size:14px;line-height:21px}}

/* ═══ 2. HEADER / NAV ═══ */
.site-header{position:fixed;top:66px;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%);width:calc(100% - 48px);max-width:1400px;z-index:110;transition:top .3s ease;will-change:top}
.header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;height:70px;padding:0 24px 0 40px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border-radius:40px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(2,3,3,.06);gap:0}
.header-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;flex:0 0 auto;height:calc(100% - 12px);max-width:100%;margin-right:auto;min-width:0}
.header-logo img{display:block;width:auto;height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain}
.header-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.nav-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:12px 16px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:#020303;line-height:25px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;transition:background .2s;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none}
.nav-item:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.04)}

/* Desktop nav visibility */
.desktop-nav{display:flex}
@media(max-width:959px){.desktop-nav{display:none}}

/* Header CTA */
.header-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-left:38px;margin-right:38px}
.btn-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:12px 20px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:16px;border-radius:100px;border:none;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:all .25s}
.btn-cta:hover{gap:12px;background:#374151}
.btn-cta svg{width:16px;height:16px}
.btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;padding:12px 20px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:16px;border-radius:100px;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s}
.btn-primary:hover{gap:12px;background:#374151}
.btn-primary svg{width:20px;height:20px}
@media(max-width:959px){.header-cta .btn-cta{display:none}}

/* Nav collapse button */
.nav-collapse-btn{display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:100px;background:var(--blue);border:none;cursor:pointer;margin-left:auto;margin-right:38px}
.nav-collapse-btn svg{width:20px;height:20px}
.nav-collapsed .desktop-nav,.nav-collapsed .header-cta{display:none}
@media(max-width:959px){.desktop-nav{display:none !important}.header-cta{display:none !important}.nav-collapse-btn{display:flex !important}}

@media(max-width:767px){
  .site-header{top:66px;width:calc(100% - 32px)}
  .header-inner{height:56px;padding:0 24px 0 32px;border-radius:40px}
}

/* ═══ Mega Dropdown ═══ */
.nav-dropdown-wrapper{position:relative}
.nav-has-dropdown{gap:6px}
.nav-dropdown-chevron{width:12px;height:7px;transition:transform .25s ease;flex-shrink:0}
.nav-dropdown-wrapper:hover .nav-dropdown-chevron{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.mega-dropdown{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 12px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(4px);min-width:640px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(2,3,3,.15);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none;z-index:120;transition:opacity .2s ease,transform .25s ease,visibility 0s .25s}
.nav-dropdown-wrapper:hover .mega-dropdown,.mega-dropdown.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;pointer-events:auto;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);transition:opacity .2s ease,transform .25s ease,visibility 0s 0s}
.mega-inner{display:flex;gap:60px;padding:36px 40px}
.mega-left{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.mega-link-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.mega-link{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s;position:relative}
.mega-link:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.mega-link-title{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:500;line-height:26px;color:#020303}
.mega-link-desc{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:21px;color:#6b7280}
.mega-link.has-plus{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.mega-link.has-plus .mega-link-title,.mega-link.has-plus .mega-link-desc{display:block}
.mega-link.has-plus>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.mega-plus{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:400;color:#020303;width:28px;height:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0}
.mega-right{flex-shrink:0;width:260px}
.mega-card{background:var(--grey-50);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.mega-card-heading{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:400;line-height:27px;color:#020303;margin:0}
.mega-card-desc{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:21px;color:#6b7280;margin:0}
.mega-card-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:var(--blue);padding:10px 18px;border-radius:100px;background:transparent;transition:all .2s;align-self:flex-start;text-decoration:none}
.mega-card-btn:hover{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;gap:12px}

/* Two-column link grid (Products dropdown) */
.mega-left--cols2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px 20px;align-content:start}
.mega-left--cols2 .mega-link{padding:10px 12px}

/* Products dropdown: wider panel, product series + components zone + feature card */
.mega-dropdown--wide{min-width:800px;left:0;transform:translateY(4px)}
.nav-dropdown-wrapper:hover .mega-dropdown--wide,.mega-dropdown--wide.open{transform:translateY(0)}
@media(max-width:1279px){.mega-dropdown--wide{min-width:720px}}
@media(max-width:1099px){.mega-dropdown--wide{min-width:640px}}
.mega-inner--products{gap:0;padding:24px 24px 24px 28px}
.mega-left--products{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-width:0}
.mega-products-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px 14px;align-content:start;min-width:0}
.mega-product-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s;min-width:0}
.mega-product-card:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.mega-product-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:0;flex:1}
.mega-product-model{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;color:#020303;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.mega-product-tagline{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:19px;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.mega-product-img{width:60px;height:60px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--grey-100)}
.mega-divider-h{height:1px;background:var(--grey-200);margin:0}
.mega-components-heading{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#6b7280;letter-spacing:.5px;margin:0 0 8px}
.mega-components-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}
.mega-component-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s;min-width:0}
.mega-component-card:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.mega-component-img{width:44px;height:44px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;background:var(--grey-100)}
.mega-component-name{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:16px;color:#020303;text-align:center}
.mega-divider{width:1px;align-self:stretch;background:var(--grey-200);margin:0 24px}
.mega-products-card-img{width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px;background:var(--grey-100)}

/* Compact link list (Services dropdown right column) */
.mega-services{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.mega-services-heading{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;padding:0 14px 8px}
.mega-services-link{display:block;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:#020303;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s,color .15s}
.mega-services-link:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.04);color:var(--blue)}

@media(max-width:959px){.mega-dropdown{display:none !important}}
/* Mobile menu panel */
.nav-collapse-btn.open{background:#374151}
.mobile-menu-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(74,98,211,.1);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none;z-index:108;transition:opacity .2s ease,visibility 0s .2s}
.mobile-menu-overlay.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;pointer-events:auto;transition:opacity .2s ease,visibility 0s 0s}
.mobile-menu-panel{position:fixed;top:148px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(-8px);width:calc(100% - 48px);max-width:520px;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(2,3,3,.15);padding:20px;display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none;z-index:115;transition:opacity .2s ease,transform .25s ease,visibility 0s .25s}
.mobile-menu-panel.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;pointer-events:auto;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);transition:opacity .2s ease,transform .25s ease,visibility 0s 0s}
.mobile-menu-panel{max-height:calc(100vh - 160px);overflow-y:auto}
.mobile-menu-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb}
.mobile-menu-group:last-of-type{border-bottom:none}
.mobile-menu-toggle,.mobile-menu-link{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 12px;background:transparent;border:none;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;line-height:26px;color:#020303;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}
.mobile-menu-toggle:hover,.mobile-menu-link:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.mobile-menu-toggle-chevron{width:12px;height:7px;flex-shrink:0;transition:transform .25s ease}
.mobile-menu-group.open .mobile-menu-toggle-chevron{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.mobile-submenu{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;transition:max-height .3s ease,padding-bottom .3s ease}
.mobile-menu-group.open .mobile-submenu{max-height:560px;padding-bottom:12px}
.mobile-submenu-link{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:10px 12px 10px 24px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}
.mobile-submenu-link:hover{background:rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
.mobile-submenu-title{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;color:#020303}
.mobile-submenu-desc{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:19px;color:#6b7280}
.mobile-menu-cta{margin-top:8px}
.mobile-menu-cta .btn-cta{width:100%;justify-content:center}
@media(max-width:959px){.mobile-menu-panel{display:flex}}
@media(max-width:767px){.mobile-menu-panel{top:130px;width:calc(100% - 32px);padding:18px}}



/* ═══ PAGE MAIN ═══ */
.page-main{margin-top:136px}

/* ═══ HERO ═══ */
.contact-hero{width:100%;max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto 80px;padding:0 var(--pad-100)}
.contact-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}
.contact-hero-content{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.contact-hero-label{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:var(--grey-500);line-height:22px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:8px}
.contact-hero h1{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:48px;font-weight:400;line-height:56px;letter-spacing:-.47px;color:var(--black);margin:0}
.contact-hero-desc{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;line-height:28px;color:var(--grey-text);max-width:460px;margin-top:16px}
.contact-direct{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:32px;padding:24px;background:var(--grey-50);border-radius:12px}
.contact-direct h3{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--black);line-height:22px}
.contact-direct a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:var(--blue);line-height:25px;transition:color .2s}
.contact-direct a:hover{color:#374151}
.contact-direct-icon{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--grey-500)}

/* ═══ FORM ═══ */
.contact-form-card{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--grey-200);border-radius:20px;padding:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px}
.form-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.form-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.form-group.full{grid-column:1/-1}
.form-group label{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--black);line-height:21px}
.form-group input,.form-group textarea,.form-group select{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:24px;color:var(--black);padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--grey-200);border-radius:10px;background:var(--white);transition:border-color .2s;outline:none;resize:vertical}
.form-group input:focus,.form-group textarea:focus,.form-group select:focus{border-color:var(--blue)}
.form-group input::placeholder,.form-group textarea::placeholder{color:var(--grey-400)}
.audit-badge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 20px;background:var(--grey-50);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:8px}
.audit-badge-icon{flex-shrink:0;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--blue);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff}
.audit-badge-text{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:21px;color:var(--black)}
.audit-badge-text strong{font-weight:600}

/* ═══ FAQ ═══ */
.faq-section{padding:100px 0;background:var(--grey-50)}
.faq-container{width:100%;max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--pad-100)}
.faq-header{margin-bottom:48px}
.faq-header h2{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:400;line-height:40px;color:var(--black);margin:0}
.faq-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;max-width:800px}
.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--grey-200)}
.faq-item:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--grey-200)}
.faq-question{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:24px 0;font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;line-height:26px;color:var(--black);background:transparent;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;transition:color .2s}
.faq-question:hover{color:var(--blue)}
.faq-toggle{flex-shrink:0;width:28px;height:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--grey-200);transition:all .2s;margin-left:16px}
.faq-question:hover .faq-toggle{border-color:var(--blue)}
.faq-toggle svg{transition:transform .2s}
.faq-item.open .faq-toggle svg{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.faq-answer{padding:0 0 24px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:25px;color:var(--grey-text)}
.faq-answer a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}
.faq-answer a:hover{color:#374151}

/* ═══ CTA ═══ */
.contact-cta{padding:0 0 100px;text-align:center}
.contact-cta-container{width:100%;max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--pad-100)}

/* ═══ RESPONSIVE ═══ */
@media(max-width:1279px){
  .contact-hero{padding:0 40px}
  .faq-container,.contact-cta-container{padding:0 40px}
}
@media(max-width:959px){
  .contact-hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
}
@media(max-width:767px){
  .contact-hero{padding:0 24px;margin-bottom:60px}
  .contact-hero h1{font-size:36px;line-height:44px;letter-spacing:-.35px}
  .contact-hero-desc{font-size:16px;line-height:26px}
  .form-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .contact-form-card{padding:24px}
  .faq-container,.contact-cta-container{padding:0 24px}
  .faq-section{padding:60px 0}
  .faq-header h2{font-size:28px;line-height:36px}
}
/* ═══ FOOTER ═══ */
.site-footer{background:var(--black);color:#fff;width:100vw;position:relative;left:50%;right:50%;margin-left:-50vw;margin-right:-50vw;padding:120px 0}
.footer-container{padding:0 var(--pad-100);max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;gap:60px}
.footer-col h4{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;line-height:27px;margin-bottom:16px}
.footer-col a{display:block;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:#fff;line-height:25px;padding:6px 0;transition:color .2s}
.footer-col a:hover{color:#b4b4b4}
.footer-col-cta h4{font-size:42px;line-height:50px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px}
.footer-col-cta p{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:25px;color:var(--black)}
.footer-col-cta .btn-primary{color:#fff;background:var(--blue)}
.footer-cta-arrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center}
.footer-contact-link{display:block;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:#fff;line-height:25px;padding:6px 0;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#563cfa;text-underline-offset:4px;transition:text-decoration-color .2s}
.footer-contact-link:hover{text-decoration-color:transparent}
.footer-contact-text{display:block;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:#fff;line-height:25px;padding:6px 0}
.footer-company-info{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:21px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}
.footer-col-info a{font-size:14px;line-height:21px;padding:2px 0;color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#563cfa;text-underline-offset:3px}
.footer-col-info a:hover{text-decoration-color:transparent}
.our-work-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:var(--blue);background:transparent;padding:12px 20px;border:1px solid var(--blue);border-radius:100px;transition:all .2s;white-space:nowrap}
.our-work-link:hover{background:var(--blue);color:#fff;gap:12px}
.our-work-link svg{width:16px;height:16px}
@media(max-width:959px){.site-footer{padding:60px 0}.footer-container{padding:0 var(--pad-40)}.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}.footer-col-cta h4{font-size:30px;line-height:38px}}
@media(max-width:767px){.footer-container{padding:0 var(--pad-24)}.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.footer-col-cta h4{font-size:26px;line-height:34px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<SiteHeader />

<main class="page-main">

  <!-- ═══ HERO + FORM ═══ -->
  <section class="contact-hero">
    <div class="contact-hero-grid">
      <div class="contact-hero-content">
        <span class="contact-hero-label">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.hero.label')}</span>
        <h1>{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.hero.title')}</h1>
        <p class="contact-hero-desc">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.hero.description')}</p>

        <div class="contact-direct">
          <h3>{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.direct.heading')}</h3>
          <a href="mailto:service@ishineco.com">
            <svg class="contact-direct-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M2 7l10 7 10-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            service@ishineco.com
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+8615012891148">
            <svg class="contact-direct-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            +86 150 1289 1148
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Form -->
      <div class="contact-form-card">
        <div class="audit-badge">
          <div class="audit-badge-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87L18.18 22 12 18.56 5.82 22 7 14.14l-5-4.87 6.91-1.01L12 2z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="audit-badge-text"><strong>{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.auditStrong')}</strong> {t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.auditText')}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group"><label for="first-name">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.firstNameLabel')}</label><input id="first-name" type="text" placeholder={t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.firstNamePlaceholder')} required /></div>
          <div class="form-group"><label for="last-name">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.lastNameLabel')}</label><input id="last-name" type="text" placeholder={t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.lastNamePlaceholder')} required /></div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group"><label for="email">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.emailLabel')}</label><input id="email" type="email" placeholder={t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.emailPlaceholder')} required /></div>
          <div class="form-group"><label for="phone">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.phoneLabel')}</label><input id="phone" type="tel" placeholder={t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.phonePlaceholder')} /></div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group full"><label for="company">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.companyLabel')}</label><input id="company" type="text" placeholder={t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.companyPlaceholder')} /></div>
        <div class="form-group full"><label for="message">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.messageLabel')}</label><textarea id="message" rows="5" placeholder={t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.messagePlaceholder')} required></textarea></div>
        <button class="btn-primary" type="submit" style="width:fit-content">{t(locale, 'develoContent.contact.form.submit')}
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ FAQ ═══ -->
  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="faq-container">
      <div class="faq-header">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item open">
          <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            How do we get started?
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">The first step is a quick call so we can understand your product concept, target market and volume expectations. It is also a chance for you to see how our OEM/ODM process works, from specification review to sample approval and mass production.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            What are your minimum order quantities?
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" style="display:none">We support low minimum order quantities. Our no-MOQ program lets you test the market with small batches first, then scale production as your brand grows — without heavy upfront inventory risk.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            How long does it take to get a sample?
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" style="display:none">For existing models, samples ship within 3-5 business days. For custom-designed devices, prototypes typically take 2-4 weeks depending on the complexity of the design, tooling and features.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            How do we communicate during a project?
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" style="display:none">You get a dedicated account manager with direct communication through email, WhatsApp or WeChat. We provide regular production updates with photos and video reports so you always know where your project stands.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            Can we visit your factory?
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" style="display:none">Yes. We are based in Shenzhen, China, and welcome factory visits. You can walk through our production lines, QC lab and warehouse — most projects begin with a video factory tour, with in-person visits arranged when helpful.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
            How much does an IPL device cost?
            <span class="faq-toggle"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" style="display:none">Pricing depends on specifications — energy output, features, materials and packaging — as well as order volume. Share your requirements and we will provide a detailed quote after spec review. For a full overview of how we work, see our <a href="/services/oem-odm">OEM/ODM page</a>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<!-- ═══ Footer ═══ -->
<SiteFooter lang={locale} />

</body>
</html>
